  firstText: 'A margin in Eleanor Blackwood''s hand: "The shelf in the east wall
    is a lock. The books are the key. Even the order in which he loses follows a
    pattern."'
  secondText: She underlined east. Not these west stacks.
  soundResource: 
  tellText: 
  carriesTell: 0
